+# Harness patches
+
+These patches carry the general-purpose dsh-side changes this plugin still needs; a
+patch stays here (and is rebased on each harness release) while the capability has no
+official extension point.
+
+## 0001-verify-bundle-optional-imports.patch
+
+**Against:** `dsh-v0.1.2-alpha.2` (`.dsh-migrate/harness`, HEAD `0a53fb5`).
+**Why:** the plugin's documented failure mode is "static install and typecheck stay
+green and only the cold boot crashes" when a bundle statically imports a package its
+own manifest declares optional. The harness documents that rule and enforces it for
+its own packages (`scripts/verify-optional-dependency-imports.ts`), but not for
+bundles installed into a profile. The patch applies the same rule at profile
+composition, before the Loader imports any row, and follows the in-repo gate's
+type-phase allowances (a clause that binds only types is not a load).
+
+Apply from the harness checkout root:
+
+```sh
+git apply /path/to/plugin/patches/0001-verify-bundle-optional-imports.patch
+```
+
+Full proposal, evidence, and open questions: [`../.dsh-migrate/patch-reports/bundle-optional-import-verification/report.md`](../.dsh-migrate/patch-reports/bundle-optional-import-verification/report.md).
